     REQUESTED ONLY: STATISTIC CARD ANIMATION + CATEGORY LABELS  
     No HTML structure, form logic, backend placeholders, or other  
     page styling has been changed in this addition.  
========================================================== -->  <style>  
/* My Balance, Total Orders, My Spent, Announcement: subtle animation */  
#main_container .user_statistic_wraper .statistic__item {  
    position: relative;  
    overflow: hidden;  
    animation: sfStatisticFloat 3.8s ease-in-out infinite;  
